r karier dalam membangun ketahanan mental dan meraih kesuksesan profesional jangka panjang tanpa dibatasi oleh status hubungan kerja.','ind','331.5',NULL,1,'','','',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,0,'2026-10-22 07:59:53','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,1),(38870,'BIB003309','BIB003309','Jalan Demokrasi Kita: Etika Politik, Rasionalitas, dan Kesalehan Publik','Masdar Hilmy; Dino Sanggrha Irnanda','','Intrans Publishing','Malang','2017','Malang : Intrans Publishing, 2017','Demokrasi; Politik dan Pemerintahan','x, 216 hlm. : 15,5 x 23 cm','978-979-3580-97-5','321.8 MAS j','','ind','321.8',NULL,1,'','','',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,0,'2026-10-22 07:59:53','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,1),(38871,'BIB003310','BIB003310','Model kebijakan yang memihak kelompok orang miskin berbasis good governance','Agus R. Rahman; Moch. Nurhasim; Heru Cahyono; Rahadi T. Wiratama; Setya Iswanti; Junaedi Mulawardana','','LIPI Press','Jakarta','2014','Jakarta : LIPI Press, 2014','Kebijakan; Good Governance; Penanggulangan Kemiskinan','xii, 105 hlm.: 14,8 x 21 cm','978-979-799-773-1','320.6 MOC m','','ind','320.6',NULL,1,'','','',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,0,'2026-10-22 07:59:53','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,1),(38872,'BIB003311','BIB003311','Berwirausaha cerdas: inspirasi bagi kaum muda','Rintan Saragih','1','Graha Ilmu','Yogyakarta','2013','Yogyakarta : Graha Ilmu, 2013','Inspirasi; Kewirausahaan','xiv, 92 hlm.: 26 cm','978-979-756-981-5','338.04 SAR b','[Info Detail Spesifik] Cetakan pertama','ind','338.04',NULL,1,'','','',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,0,'2026-10-22 07:59:53','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,1),(38873,'BIB003312','BIB003312','Menakar Kesetaraan Hak dan Kewajiban Perpajakan Di Indonesia','Nuryadi Mulyodiwarno; Maria R.U.D. Tambunan','1','PT RajaGrafindo Persada','Depok','2018','Depok : PT RajaGrafindo Persada, 2018','