 catatan perjalanan tersebut, pembaca dapat mengenal berbagai masyarakat, kota, kerajaan, tradisi, dan kehidupan masyarakat yang ditemui Ibnu Battuta selama pengembaraannya. Buku ini sekaligus memberikan gambaran mengenai hubungan antarmasyarakat dan luasnya jaringan dunia Islam pada abad ke-14.',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:32','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(209390,35832,'600','0','#','$a Islam; Biografi',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:32','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(209391,35832,'008','#','#','$a 261022#############################ind##',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:32','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(209392,35833,'245','#','#','$a Zikir 1001 Asma\'ul Husna dan Fadhilah Surah Yasin $c Tim Zahra',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:32','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(209393,35833,'710','#','#','$a Tim Zahra',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:32','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(209394,35833,'264','#','1','$a Jakarta $b Zahra Publishing House $c 2008',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:32','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(209395,35833,'300','#','#','$a 296 hlm. 15 cm.',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:32','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(209396,35833,'020','#','#','$a 978-979-26-6528-4',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:32','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(209397,35833,'082','#','#','$a 297.32',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:32','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(209398,35833,'084','#','#','$a 297.32 ZIK',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:32','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(209399,35833,'008','#','#','$a 261022#############################ind##',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:32','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(209400,35834,'245','#','#','$a Semiotika komunikasi $c Alex Sobur',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:32','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(209401,35834,'100','0','#','$a Alex Sobur',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:32','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(209402,35834,'264','#','1','$a Bandung $b PT Remaja Rosdakarya $c 2004',0,NULL,'202