laim. Berdasarkan hasil kajian empiris, laporan ini merekomendasikan penerapaan jaminan sosial secara bertahap: penerapan skema swadaya mandiri berprioritas JHT/JPK bagi wilayah perkebunan yang matang, skema bersubsidi pemerintah untuk pola tanaman pangan, perlindungan risiko force majeure kegagalan panen, serta penyempurnaan regulasi pengawasan dan mekanisme rujukan kesehatan bagi para transmigran.',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:33','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(211259,36036,'600','0','#','$a Tenaga Kerja',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:33','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(211260,36036,'008','#','#','$a 261022#############################ind##',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:33','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(211261,36037,'245','#','#','$a Cara membuat 46 jenis barang kebutuhan sehari-hari $c T. Soeyanto',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:34','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(211262,36037,'100','0','#','$a T. Soeyanto',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:34','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(211263,36037,'264','#','1','$a Jakarta $b Yudhistira $c 1981',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:34','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(211264,36037,'300','#','#','$a 94 hlm.: 17 cm',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:34','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(211265,36037,'082','#','#','$a 745.5',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:34','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(211266,36037,'084','#','#','$a 745.5 SOE c',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:34','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(211267,36037,'600','0','#','$a Kerajinan Tangan',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:34','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(211268,36037,'008','#','#','$a 261022#############################ind##',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:34','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(211269,36038,'245','#','#','$a Studi Pengembangan Pemukiman Transmigrasi Pola Usaha Pangan $c Rukmini Nugroho Dewi',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:34','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(211270,36038,'100','0','#','$a Rukmini Nugroho Dewi, dk