an angkatan kerja. Berfungsi sebagai media diseminasi wawasan dan ruang dialektika kebijakan publik, kompilasi artikel ini menjadi rujukan analitis yang esensial bagi aparatur dinas ketenagakerjaan, praktisi manajemen SDM (human resources), pengurus serikat pekerja, pengusaha, serta akademisi dalam memperkaya perspektif teoretis maupun praktis guna merumuskan tata kelola ketenagakerjaan yang adil, inklusif, dan berdaya saing.',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:40','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(221228,37083,'600','0','#','$a Ketenagakerjaan',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:40','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(221229,37083,'008','#','#','$a 261022#############################ind##',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:40','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(221230,37084,'245','#','#','$a Coaching for Staff Development = Pelatihan untuk Pengembangan Karyawan $c Thomas, Angela M.',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:40','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(221231,37084,'100','0','#','$a Thomas, Angela M.',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:40','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(221232,37084,'264','#','1','$a Yogyakarta $b Kanisius $c 1997',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:40','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(221233,37084,'300','#','#','$a 184 hlm.; 21 cm',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:40','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(221234,37084,'020','#','#','$a 979-672-068-x',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:40','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(221235,37084,'082','#','#','$a 331.259 2',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:40','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(221236,37084,'084','#','#','$a 331.259 2 THO c',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:40','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(221237,37084,'600','0','#','$a Produktivitas tenaga Kerja; Pekerja -- Pendidikan dan latihan',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:40','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(221238,37084,'008','#','#','$a 261022#############################ind##',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:40','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(221239,3