awaian (PPK), pranata sumber daya manusia aparatur, analis kepegawaian, pimpinan kementerian/lembaga/pemerintah daerah, mahasiswa ilmu administrasi publik, serta peneliti kebijakan publik dalam mewujudkan tata kelola kepemerintahan yang baik (good public governance).',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:45','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(228938,37906,'600','0','#','$a Pegawai Manajemen; Aparatur Sipil Negara',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:45','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(228939,37906,'008','#','#','$a 261022#############################ind##',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:45','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(228940,37907,'245','#','#','$a Sentralisasi Birokrasi Pengadaan Barang dan Jasa Pemerintah $c Arsyad, Jawade Hafidz',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:45','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(228941,37907,'100','0','#','$a Arsyad, Jawade Hafidz',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:45','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(228942,37907,'700','0','#','$a Karisma, Dian',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:45','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(228943,37907,'264','#','1','$a Jakarta $b Sinar Grafika $c 2018',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:45','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(228944,37907,'300','#','#','$a xiv+519 hlm.; 23 cm.',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:45','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(228945,37907,'020','#','#','$a 978-979-007-770-6',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:45','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(228946,37907,'082','#','#','$a 352.283',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:45','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(228947,37907,'084','#','#','$a 352.283 JAW s',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:45','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(228948,37907,'600','0','#','$a Sentralisasi dalam pemerintahan',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:45','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(228949,37907,'008','#','#','$a 261022#############################ind##',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:45','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(228950,37908,'245','#','#','$a Administrasi Pembanguna