 penanganan keluh kesah awal, serta pengawasan mutu dan kepatuhan standar keselamatan kerja operasional guna menjembatani target kebijakan manajemen puncak dengan pelaksanaan teknis di lapangan. Buku ini berfungsi sebagai rujukan edukatif dan instrumen pelatihan mandiri yang esensial bagi para calon penyelia baru, team leader, staf promosi jabatan manajerial awal, fasilitator pelatihan korporasi, serta praktisi sumber daya manusia (human resources) dalam membangun kepemimpinan lini depan yang andal, adaptif, dan berorientasi pada pencapaian produktivitas tim.',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:49','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(233495,38392,'600','0','#','$a Manajer',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:49','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(233496,38392,'008','#','#','$a 261022#############################ind##',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:49','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(233497,38393,'245','#','#','$a Ledakan Informasi dan Manajemen $c McFarlan, F. Warren',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:49','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(233498,38393,'100','0','#','$a McFarlan, F. Warren',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:49','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(233499,38393,'700','0','#','$a McKenney, James L.',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:49','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(233500,38393,'264','#','1','$a Jakarta $b PPM $c 1987',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:49','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(233501,38393,'300','#','#','$a xv+286 hlm.; ilus.; 24 cm.',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:49','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(233502,38393,'020','#','#','$a -',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:49','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(233503,38393,'082','#','#','$a 658.403 8',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:49','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(233504,38393,'084','#','#','$a 658.403 8 MAC l',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:49','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(233505,38393,'600','0','#','$a Manajemen informasi',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 07:59:49','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NU