 sekaligus sosiologis-yuridis, buku ini menjadi rujukan ilmiah esensial bagi praktisi hukum ketenagakerjaan, hakim perburuhan, akademisi, pengurus serikat pekerja/buruh, konsultan hubungan industrial korporasi, serta perumus kebijakan ketenagakerjaan dalam memahami evolusi hak asasi buruh, memitigasi ketegangan industrial, dan menavigasi arah pembaruan hukum ketenagakerjaan nasional secara adil serta berkeadaban.',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 08:00:16','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(260141,41116,'008','#','#','$a 261022#############################ind##',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 08:00:16','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(260142,41117,'245','#','#','$a Dana Bergulir Edisi 168 Tahun XVII April-Juni 2025 $c LPDB KUMKM',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 08:00:16','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(260143,41117,'110','#','#','$a LPDB KUMKM',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 08:00:16','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(260144,41117,'264','#','1','$a Jakarta $b LPDB KUMKM $c 2025',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 08:00:16','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(260145,41117,'300','#','#','$a 42 hlm.; 28 cm.',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 08:00:16','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(260146,41117,'082','#','#','$a 051',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 08:00:16','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(260147,41117,'084','#','#','$a 051 DAN',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 08:00:16','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(260148,41117,'008','#','#','$a 261022#############################ind##',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 08:00:16','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(260149,41118,'245','#','#','$a Analisis Jabatan 2008 $c Moekijat',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 08:00:16','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(260150,41118,'100','0','#','$a Moekijat',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 08:00:16','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(260151,41118,'264','#','1','$a Bandung $b CV Mandar Maju $c 2008',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 08:00:16','SLIMS_MIGRATION',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1),(260152,41118,'300','#','#','$a xii, 176 Halaman ; 21 cm.',0,NULL,'2026-10-22 08:00:16